    "purpose": "Text-to-Speech (TTS) synthesizer utilizing the ultra-fast, local, CPU-friendly piper engine. Converts transcripts, summaries, or lessons into studio-quality offline spoken audio (WAV/MP3) without cloud subscriptions.",
